// laptop-os dock favorites (COSMIC panel dock).
//
// cosmic-config stores one RON value per file; the dock's pinned apps live in
// the com.system76.CosmicAppList component, key `favorites`, version 1. Installed
// to /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicAppList/v1/favorites by
// build/50-cosmic-desktop.sh, after the cosmic RPMs land, so the image default
// is not clobbered by a package-shipped schema file.
//
// This path is the system default: cosmic-config falls back to it
// (XDG_DATA_DIRS, prefix `cosmic`) on a per-key basis, so it applies to any user
// who has not pinned apps themselves. Existing users keep their own file at
// ~/.config/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicAppList/v1/favorites; `ujust
// set-dock-layout` overwrites that.
//
// IDs are stored WITHOUT the .desktop suffix (cosmic's get_app_id strips it),
// and resolution is fuzzy: StartupWMClass, file stem, Name, Exec. An ID that
// matches nothing is NOT dropped - it renders as a broken placeholder icon, so
// a typo is visible rather than silent. build/50-cosmic-desktop.sh verifies
// the OS-shipped IDs and build/30-browsers.sh verifies the browsers.
[
    "librewolf",
    "brave-origin",
    "com.system76.CosmicFiles",
    "eu.betterbird.Betterbird",
    "com.system76.CosmicTerm",
    "org.gnome.gitlab.cheywood.Buffer",
]
